// ░██████╗████████╗██╗░░░██╗██╗░░░░░███████╗░██████╗  ███████╗░█████╗░██████╗░
// ██╔════╝╚══██╔══╝╚██╗░██╔╝██║░░░░░██╔════╝██╔════╝  ██╔════╝██╔══██╗██╔══██╗
// ╚█████╗░░░░██║░░░░╚████╔╝░██║░░░░░█████╗░░╚█████╗░  █████╗░░██║░░██║██████╔╝
// ░╚═══██╗░░░██║░░░░░╚██╔╝░░██║░░░░░██╔══╝░░░╚═══██╗  ██╔══╝░░██║░░██║██╔══██╗
// ██████╔╝░░░██║░░░░░░██║░░░███████╗███████╗██████╔╝  ██║░░░░░╚█████╔╝██║░░██║
// ╚═════╝░░░░╚═╝░░░░░░╚═╝░░░╚══════╝╚══════╝╚═════╝░  ╚═╝░░░░░╚════╝░╚═╝░░╚═╝

configuration {
    show-icons:           true;
    font:                 "JetBrainsMono Nerd Font 10";
    drun-display-format:  "{name}";
}

@import "../colors.rasi"

/* Main Window Setup */
window {
    enabled:              true;
    fullscreen:           false;
    location:             center;
    anchor:               center;
    width:                1240px;
    transparency:         "real";
    cursor:               "default";
    spacing:              0px;
    padding:              20px;
    border:               2px;
    border-color:         @primary;
    border-radius:        20px;
    background-color:     @surface;
}

/* Main Container */
mainbox {
    enabled:              true;
    orientation:          vertical;
    spacing:              18px;
    background-color:     transparent;
    children:             [ "inputbar", "listview" ];
}

/* Input / Search Bar Header */
inputbar {
    enabled:              true;
    spacing:              10px;
    padding:              12px 18px;
    border-radius:        14px;
    background-color:     @surface-container-high;
    text-color:           @on-surface;
    children:             [ "prompt", "entry" ];
}

prompt {
    enabled:              true;
    background-color:     transparent;
    text-color:           @primary;
    font:                 "JetBrainsMono Nerd Font Bold 10";
}

entry {
    enabled:              true;
    background-color:     transparent;
    text-color:           @on-surface;
    placeholder:          "Search wallpapers...";
    placeholder-color:    @outline;
    cursor:               text;
}

/* Wallpaper Grid Layout */
listview {
    enabled:              true;
    columns:              5;
    lines:                2;
    spacing:              16px;
    padding:              4px;
    cycle:                true;
    dynamic:              true;
    scrollbar:            false;
    layout:               vertical;
    reverse:              false;
    fixed-height:         true;
    fixed-columns:        true;
    cursor:               "default";
    background-color:     transparent;
    text-color:           @on-surface;
}

/* Wallpaper Card Element */
element {
    enabled:              true;
    orientation:          vertical;
    children:             [ "element-icon", "element-text" ];
    spacing:              8px;
    padding:              10px;
    border-radius:        14px;
    border:               2px;
    border-color:         transparent;
    cursor:               pointer;
    background-color:     @surface-container-low;
    text-color:           @on-surface;
}

element normal.normal {
    background-color:     @surface-container-low;
    text-color:           @on-surface;
}

element selected.normal {
    background-color:     @surface-container-highest;
    border-color:         @primary;
    text-color:           @primary;
}

element alternate.normal {
    background-color:     @surface-container-low;
    text-color:           @on-surface;
}

/* Thumbnail Image Styling */
element-icon {
    size:                 200px;
    horizontal-align:     0.5;
    vertical-align:       0.5;
    border-radius:        10px;
    background-color:     transparent;
    text-color:           inherit;
    cursor:               inherit;
}

/* Wallpaper Title Label */
element-text {
    horizontal-align:     0.5;
    vertical-align:       0.5;
    background-color:     transparent;
    text-color:           inherit;
    font:                 "JetBrainsMono Nerd Font 9";
    cursor:               inherit;
}

/* Error Handling UI */
error-message {
    padding:              15px;
    border-radius:        14px;
    text-color:           @on-surface;
    background-color:     @surface;
    children:             [ "textbox" ];
}

textbox {
    text-color:           inherit;
    background-color:     inherit;
    vertical-align:       0.5;
    horizontal-align:     0.5;
}
